    "raw": "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated. \nPhase change: 1363 K, melting point of SiS; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 7.41$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 1 3 6 3 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 9. 6 6 5 + 3. 6 1 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 0 0 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 9. 6 6 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 1. 8 0 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 0. 0 0 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 3. 0 4 0 \\\\ 1 3 6 3 - 1 6 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 1 6. 0 0 0 \\\\ \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 1 6. 0 0 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 9 0 8 \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 1 3 6 3 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 5 5. 3 6 8 - 0. 1 8 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 1. 2 9 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 1 3 3. 2 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = - 5 5. 3 6 8 + 0. 1 8 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} - 1. 2 9 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 6 6. 6 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 1 5. 4 7 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ 1 3 6 3 - 1 6 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 5 3. 2 3 6 + 6. 1 5 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 5 1 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 1 3 2. 6 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {0} = - 5 3. 2 3 6 - 6. 1 5 0 x 1 0 ^ {- 3} T \\ln T + 0. 5 1 1 x 1 0 ^ {- 6} T ^ {2} - 6 6. 3 2 5 T ^ {- 1} + 5 7. 1 6 9 x 1 0 ^ {- 3} T \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nSource: Data from Gurvich (49) who estimated all except enthalpy of formation at 298 K. ",
